//RS     // Nested root entries keep the installed callback and the caller's other
//RS     // ambient hooks. The outer with_ambient scope restores its previous hooks
//RS     // on both return and unwind; the Driver reuses an active compiler worker.
//RS     if Comptime::ambient_hooks()
